<title>UK: RTZ sinks on bad press after results.</title>
<headline>RTZ sinks on bad press after results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in RTZ Corp sank on Friday following negative press comments on the mining giant's results, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 0856 GMT, the shares were down 12p to 937, having advanced 5-1/2p on Thursday after releasing its 1996 profits.</p>
</text>
